# Copy to .env.local (or set these in your host's project settings, e.g.
# Vercel -> Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables) and fill in.
#
# Leave VITE_API_URL unset for local dev (npm run dev) — the Vite dev proxy in
# vite.config.ts already forwards /api and /ws to 127.0.0.1:8000 — and for any
# deploy where the API is served same-origin with the static build.
#
# Set it when the frontend is deployed separately from the backend, e.g. this
# app on Vercel talking to a Morph Fleet worker reachable at a public URL:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.morph.dev
#
# No trailing slash, no /api suffix — just the backend's origin. The
# WebSocket used for live experiment progress is derived from this
# automatically (wss:// in place of https://).
VITE_API_URL=
